    "binary transient": "OrbitBinaryDepth: actual native held-rank iteration, reduced denominator formula, every earlier even denominator, first odd denominator exactly at counted binary depth and stable odd core afterward. Quantified over all supplied positive reduced parts with the original binary-factor/odd-core decomposition.",
    "complete orbit support": "OrbitCycleSupport: no collision before the first binary order, injective indexed positions, exact cardinality and periodicity for every admitted reduced part.",
    "four original witnesses": "OrbitNumberWitnesses: original five order values, all reduced ranks through odd99, all ten prime-divisibility witnesses and original73-residue tiling count. Every original49 denominator case is retained as a separate checked lemma.",
    "native execution comparison": "Fresh Lean execution compared directly with unchanged pinned _fold_rank/_order_two/_orbit:2006 complete traces and57842 ordered positions agree."
  },
